## 1. The spec comes first
   concept: openapi/v2.yaml (OpenAPI 3.1, JSON Schema 2020-12) is written before the handlers and linted in CI; the router, both validators, the client types, the contract test and the reference page all read it
   $ npx redocly lint openapi/v1.yaml openapi/v2.yaml openapi/v2-breaking.yaml --format=summary
   | validating openapi/v1.yaml...
   | openapi/v1.yaml: validated in 56ms
   | validating openapi/v2.yaml...
   | openapi/v2.yaml: validated in 30ms
   | validating openapi/v2-breaking.yaml...
   | openapi/v2-breaking.yaml: validated in 20ms
   | Woohoo! Your API descriptions are valid. 🎉
